Welcome to Family Logic 101.
Please take a seat. Not that one. That one's for the cousin they say is prettier.
Lesson one:
Your success is a personal attack on them.
Lesson two:
Casino night is non-negotiable.
Hospitals can wait.
Lesson three:
Your grief has a two-month limit.
After that, they want to know where the boyfriend is.
Lesson four:
If you're upset, you're dramatic.
If they're upset, it's your fault.
Final exam:
You get told to go get a job.
At forty-three.
Class dismissed.
Drop your family logic below. We're grading on a curve.
